OL,3,GNEWSAAwards success for BBC Cornish
OL,4,Alanguage podcast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC podcast helping people to take
OL,7,Ftheir first steps towards learning the
OL,8,FCornish language has collected three
OL,9,Fprestigious awards.
OL,11,FThe Learn Cornish podcast is presented
OL,12,Fby BBC Radio 1's Danni Diston and
OL,13,Flanguage expert Sarah Buck and combines
OL,14,FCornish language lessons with
OL,15,Fconversation about Cornwall's wider
OL,16,Fhistory and culture.
OL,18,FThe judges at the Gorsedh Kernow Awards
OL,19,Fpraised the BBC Sounds podcast, which
OL,20,Flaunched in May, as "ground-breaking".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
